message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and the archived release."
title: "PyPSA-VN-PDP8: planned versus least-cost power system for Vietnam"
abstract: >-
  Open capacity-expansion model of Vietnam's power system built with PyPSA and Snakemake. It compares the revised
  Power Development Plan VIII (Decisions 768/QĐ-TTg and 1509/QĐ-BCT) with a least-cost system for 2035 and 2040
  under identical adequacy and security constraints, attributes the cost gap to the plan's components with Shapley
  values, and tests it with near-optimal, Monte Carlo, weather-year and stress-test analyses.
